    <comment>- fix description

- Update to version 2.0.1 (upstream tag 2.0.1-7):
  * PulseAudio: set PA_STREAM_ADJUST_LATENCY on playback and record
    streams for correct latency handling
  * WASAPI: switch to event-driven callbacks, fix a memory leak and
    hardcode GUIDs when compiling as C (Windows-only)
  * SOVERSION unchanged, no API changes
- Spec cleanup: drop Group tags, use %ldconfig_scriptlets</comment>
